# lib/storage.warp's rules that run code at compile time, its whole program or a rule word of extensions/rules/rule_words.warp:
# the compiler keeps them, taken with the module's own (rewrites.warp module_rule_paths; decision library-zero-bake-plan 1b)
// a table's add and remove, and a write of its class's field, kept in the database (extensions/rules/rule_words.warp tables_kept)
rewrite $p => $q where program and $q = tables_kept($p)
